\f0\b\fs34 \cf2 Ragboard Overview: Visual Board-Style AI Interface
\f1\b0\fs28 \
\
This web app is designed to function as a visual board-style interface that connects diverse knowledge resources to an AI chat system\'97primarily Claude, though it will support other LLMs as well. The goal is to enable context-rich conversations with AI by visually linking it to specific content and media resources from various sources.\
