\f0\b\fs34 \cf2 Summary
\f1\b0\fs28 \
\
This app combines a drag-and-drop visual experience with robust retrieval-augmented AI functionality. By allowing users to import, transcribe, analyze, and visually link resources, it transforms scattered information into a coherent, chat-friendly knowledge map. The integration of folders, real-time content analysis, and full LLM interoperability (starting with Claude) positions this as a versatile, user-friendly RAG tool for content-rich workflows.}